        <mxCell id="proxy" parent="bffLane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#78350F;" value="src/frontend/m-mcm/proxy.ts (Next middleware)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;/portal/* 인증 보호&lt;br&gt;/api/* 인증/RBAC 게이트&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;forward 헤더 (BFF↔BE shared secret 모델):&lt;br&gt;· X-Client-Key (env: BACKEND_CLIENT_KEY)&lt;br&gt;· X-Authenticated-User (token.sub)&lt;br&gt;· X-Authenticated-Role (token.roles join &quot;,&quot;)&lt;br&gt;※ 사용자 JWT(Authorization Bearer) 는 더 이상 forward 하지 않음&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;BFF self-fetch: X-Internal-Bff-Call=1&lt;br&gt;+ X-Authenticated-User/Role fallback (RBAC warmup)" vertex="1">
