        <mxCell id="oasisRoute" parent="bffLane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E8FF;strokeColor=#9333EA;fontSize=13;fontColor=#581C87;" value="src/frontend/m-mcm/app/api/[module]/oasis/[serviceId]/[action]/route.ts&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;createOasisProxyHandler (from @dk-oasis/shared/oasis-proxy)&lt;br&gt;/api/{module}/oasis/{id}/{action} → ${module_url}/oasis/{id}/{action}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;forward 헤더 3 종 (BFF↔BE shared secret 모델, 2026-05-21~):&lt;br&gt;· X-Client-Key + X-Authenticated-User + X-Authenticated-Role&lt;br&gt;※ Authorization Bearer 제거 — BE 가 X-Client-Key 로 BFF 신뢰&lt;br&gt;(OASIS 그대로 전달, cactus OasisController 매핑 단순화)" vertex="1">
