        <mxCell id="authRoute" parent="bffLane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE4E6;strokeColor=#E11D48;fontSize=13;fontColor=#881337;" value="src/frontend/m-mcm/app/api/auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts (위임형 handlers.ts)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;shared auth server&lt;br&gt;backendAccessToken / RefreshToken 을 NextAuth JWT 에 저장 (호환 유지)&lt;br&gt;※ 2026-05-21~ BFF→BE forward 에는 미사용 (shared secret 모델로 전환)&lt;br&gt;m-mcm NextAuth → mcm BE /api/auth/login&lt;br&gt;(ClientKeyFilter skip path: /api/auth/)" vertex="1">
