        <mxCell id="backendLane" parent="1" style="swimlane;html=1;rounded=0;startSize=32;horizontal=0;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#334155;" value="Backend WAS" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1010" width="690" x="1800" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="restBackend" parent="backendLane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#16A34A;fontSize=13;fontColor=#14532D;" value="모듈 WAS (REST) — com.dongkuk.dmes.{aps|mpn|mqc}.*&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;cactus 필터 체인:&lt;br&gt;TxIdFilter → RequestIdFilter → ClientKeyFilter → JwtAuthenticationFilter&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;★ ClientKeyFilter (2026-05-21~): X-Client-Key 검증 성공 시&lt;br&gt;X-Authenticated-User / X-Authenticated-Role 헤더로 SecurityContext&lt;br&gt;사전 인증을 set → JwtAuthenticationFilter 는 사전 인증 보존 분기로&lt;br&gt;JWT 검증 자체를 스킵 (만료된 사용자 JWT 도 영향 없음)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;GET/POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE /api/* (예: /api/demands, /api/items)&lt;br&gt;(BE 매핑은 변경 없음, /api/{module}/rest/ segment 는 BFF 가 제거)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="255" width="590" x="60" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oasisBackend" parent="backendLane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#16A34A;fontSize=13;fontColor=#14532D;" value="모듈 WAS (OASIS) — com.dongkuk.dmes.{mcm|aps|mpn|mqc}.*&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;cactus 필터 체인 (동일 ClientKeyFilter 정책 — 사전 인증 set):&lt;br&gt;TxIdFilter → RequestIdFilter → ClientKeyFilter → JwtAuthenticationFilter&lt;br&gt;cactus &lt;b&gt;OasisController&lt;/b&gt; 단일 매핑:&lt;br&gt;POST /oasis/{serviceId}/{action}&lt;br&gt;예: /oasis/secMenu/search" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="580" x="70" y="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="authBackend" parent="backendLane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#16A34A;fontSize=13;fontColor=#14532D;" value="mcm BE — com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.*&#xa;McmAuthController @RequestMapping(&quot;/api/auth&quot;)&#xa;POST /api/auth/login, /api/auth/refresh, /api/auth/logout&#xa;cactus AuthService + SecUserRepository + JwtTokenProvider&#xa;mcm SecurityConfig (McmSecurityDefaults 매처) /api/auth/** permitAll&#xa;(ClientKeyFilter skip prefix: /api/auth/)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="600" x="70" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="helperBackend" parent="backendLane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#16A34A;fontSize=13;fontColor=#14532D;" value="mcm BE 또는 BFF Local / OASIS&#xa;PATCH /api/auth/change-password (※ BE REST 매핑 없음 — BFF 직접 처리 또는 OASIS 위임 필요)&#xa;POST /api/auth/reset-password (OASIS /oasis/secUser/resetPassword 사용 가능 — SecUserService.resetPassword)&#xa;쿠키 삭제(force-logout)는 BFF 에서 종료&#xa;(BFF self-fetch 시 X-Internal-Bff-Call=1 + X-Authenticated-User/Role fallback — 2026-05-21~)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="125" width="600" x="70" y="770" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
